# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 3/5, item 32
# Base: apply after 0031.
#
# Adds acceptance-EWMA control:
# - high acceptance: expand to window 4 / shallow depth 8
# - medium: window 3 / depth 12
# - low: window 2 / depth 16
#
# The proposal chooser prefers an n-gram proposal only when it agrees with the
# exact first target token. Otherwise it uses the self-speculative draft.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0032_adaptive_draft_controller.patch

